errors.Is(err, ErrNotFound) over findUser: ErrNotFound wrapped by "find %v: %w" ((*Repo).Find) and by Retry[User]'s
"after %d attempts: %w". Retry wraps `last`, which is nil when its loop never runs (n <= 0), so in general the wrap may
hold nothing and the guard may fail. With the constant n = 3 of this program the set is empty at run time; errtrace does
not track constants, so expect the entry kept and marked possibly handled ("wrapped value may be nil"), not removed.
